<title>SWEDEN: Riksbank leaves key interest rates unchanged.</title>
<headline>Riksbank leaves key interest rates unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, ended its regular board meeting on Thursday without changing its key interest rates.  </p>
<p>Out of the eleven economists Reuters polled this week, only two believed the Riksbank would cut the rates.</p>
<p>Instead, several economists forecasted a repo rate cut next Tuesday at its regular tender at 0830 GMT.</p>
<p>The repo rate stands at 4.10 percent, the deposit rate at 3.75 percent and the lending rate at 5.25 percent.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
